Problem 3. Answer the following questions:
• Can an interface inherit from an interface? from multiple interfaces? from a class?
• Can a class inherit from an interface? from multiple interfaces?
• Can a class inherit from a class? from multiple classes?

______________________________________________________________________________________
Interface from an interface? Yes, with extends.
From multiple interfaces?    Yes, interface C extends A, B is allowed.
From a class?                No. An interface can’t extend a class.


Class from an interface?     Yes, but the keyword is implements, not extends.
                             The class must provide bodies for all the interface’s abstract methods
                             (unless the class is abstract).
From multiple interfaces?    Yes, class HybridCar implements Refuelable, Chargeable.


Class from a class?          Yes, with extends.
From multiple classes?       No. Java has single inheritance for classes.

______________________________________________________________________________________
Child	    Parent	             Allowed?   Keyword
Interface	Interface	         Yes	    extends
Interface	Multiple interfaces	 Yes	    extends
Interface	Class	             No	        n/a
Class	    Interface	         Yes	    implements
Class	    Multiple interfaces	 Yes	    implements
Class	    Class	             Yes	    extends
Class	    Multiple classes	 No	        n/a
